WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:02.368
(MUFFLED COMMOTION)

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.938
If I was gonna look up
one problem cop
as a prime example

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:07.807
of what's gone wrong
here in Baltimore,

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:09.109
<i> where would I start?</i>

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.678
WAYNE JENKINS:
<i> I guess we wanna--</i>

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.280
<i> Yeah, we wanna run
a little hypothetical by you.</i>

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.449
<i> Say we're all
 on an investigation,</i>

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.950
<i> following a big time
 drug dealer,</i>

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.486
<i>a real fuckin' monster, right.</i>

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.324
<i>We, uh-- Yeah, we get wind
on where he's keeping his cash,</i>

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.229
<i>and we actually come upon
 that cash.</i>

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.431
<i>It's right there in front of us,
 and we just...</i>

00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:34.034
You know, we take it.

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.044
<i>What would you think about that?</i>

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:48.080
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:52.585
Everything changed when they
came up with that expression,
"The war on drugs."

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:55.254
<i> With a war,
comes police militarization.</i>

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.490
<i> It's a complete gutting
 of the Fourth Amendment.</i>

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.259
JEMELL RAYAM:
<i> They put me in a unit</i>

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.261
<i> made up of a bunch
 of the biggest crooks</i>

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.996
<i> in the whole goddamn
 department.</i>

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.498
<i> There's all this money
 to be made</i>

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.700
and I'm somehow supposed
to be playing by the book

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.102
with these motherfuckers?

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:15.175
Jackpot, motherfuckers! Woo!

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.513
NICOLE STEELE:
<i>So these cops caught lying,</i>

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.815
<i>and with their abusive behavior,</i>

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:23.916
remained on the street?

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:24.917
They did.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.853
RAYAM:<i> If it is the feds
 who are on this,</i>

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.020
the case could go on
for years.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.890
What case?
This ain't no Pablo Escobar.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.691
<i> This is the police.</i>

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:35.195
BRIAN GRABLER:
<i>In a war, you need warriors.</i>

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.696
On the ground!
Get down on the ground!

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:37.496
GRABLER:
<i> You have enemies.</i>

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.733
<i>In a war, civilians get hurt
and nobody does anything.</i>

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.936
In a war, you count the bodies

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.238
<i> and then
 you call them victories.</i>

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:54.547
Aren't you angry?

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:57.183
(SCOFFS)

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.552
(INHALES, EXHALES)

